// krbtgt Account Password Reset or Modified
// Detects a password reset or attribute change on the krbtgt account. Its hash signs every Kerberos ticket in the domain, so it is both the key an attacker needs for a Golden Ticket and the key a defender rotates (twice) to invalidate one. Either way, an unexpected change here is one of the highest-signal events Active Directory produces.
// techniques: T1558.001   severity: critical   status: experimental
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1558.001
//   Set-ADAccountPassword -Identity krbtgt -Reset -NewPassword (Read-Host -AsSecureString)
// source: rules/credential-access/krbtgt-account-modified.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
SecurityEvent
| where ((EventID =~ "4723" or EventID =~ "4724" or EventID =~ "4738") and (TargetUserName startswith "krbtgt"))
